    "title": "Zcash Rallies 12% on Grayscale ETF Filing and $110M Purchase Plan",
    "content": "Driven by institutional momentum and a broader market recovery, Zcash (ZEC) surged 12% after breaking out of its previous consolidation range. The rally is anchored by Grayscale advancing its spot ETF application with NYSE Arca and a Digital Currency Group subsidiary discussing a potential $110 million ZEC acquisition. To sustain this upward trajectory, ZEC must hold critical support above the $550 mark to avoid a breakdown toward $500. A decisive close above the key $600 psychological barrier would confirm the breakout and open the door for a continuation toward the $650–$700 target zone.",
